       *> USERS - record layout of Users (generated by rulebook-to-cobol).
       *> Use: COPY USERS REPLACING ==:P:== BY ==<prefix>== under a level
       *> 01-10 group. Record length: 306 bytes.
       *> A NULL field has <name>-NI = "Y"; text is <name>-LEN bytes of <name>;
       *> booleans are "Y"/"N"; numbers are packed decimal.
       *> Name (calculated, string)
           15 :P:-NAME-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-NAME-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-NAME PIC X(64).
       *> FullName (raw, string)
           15 :P:-FULL-NAME-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-FULL-NAME PIC X(64).
       *> Role (raw, string)
           15 :P:-ROLE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-ROLE PIC X(64).
       *> Email (raw, string)
           15 :P:-EMAIL-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP.
           15 :P:-EMAIL PIC X(64).
       *> IsRM (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-IS-RM-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-IS-RM PIC X.
       *> IsUnderwriter (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-IS-UNDERWRITER-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-IS-UNDERWRITER PIC X.
       *> IsBranchBanker (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-IS-BRANCH-BANKER-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-IS-BRANCH-BANKER PIC X.
       *> IsAdmin (calculated, bool)
           15 :P:-IS-ADMIN-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-IS-ADMIN PIC X.
       *> CountOfPortfolioBusinesses (aggregation, int)
           15 :P:-COUNT-OF-PORTFOLIO-BUS-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-COUNT-OF-PORTFOLIO-BUS PIC S9(18) COMP-3.
       *> CountOfOriginatedLoans (aggregation, int)
           15 :P:-COUNT-OF-ORIGINATED-LO-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-COUNT-OF-ORIGINATED-LO PIC S9(18) COMP-3.
       *> CountOfUnderwrittenLoans (aggregation, int)
           15 :P:-COUNT-OF-UNDERWRITTEN-NI PIC X.
           15 :P:-COUNT-OF-UNDERWRITTEN PIC S9(18) COMP-3.
